```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "supersede an intent under the face's root"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///face.intent.supersedes", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.intent.supersedes"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.intent.supersedes"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.intent.supersedes ~ supersede ~ a root act

`lares intent supersede <intent-id>` signs a supersede under the face's root at its current epoch.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ supersede

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`supersede` params=`target/<intent-id> ~ supersede the intent`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ target · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`target` params=`takes/id needs/required seat/1 as/<target> ~ the intent's id`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/index ~ the face whose intent plane this reads or writes, a whole persona index from 0`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ root

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`root` params=`who/seat-or-hand key/face-root ~ a ward act: the face's root seed signs once and zero-fills; a seat without the route asks the root's hearth`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · face-malformed · face-not-held · intent-id-absent · root-absent · root-rotated

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`~ an unknown sub-verb, or no sub-verb named`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-malformed` params=`~ --face names a whole persona index from 0`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-not-held` params=`~ this vessel holds no such face`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`intent-id-absent` params=`~ name the intent`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`root-absent` params=`~ this vessel holds no root; ask the root's hearth`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`root-rotated` params=`~ the root rotated past this seed`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ cid

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`cid` params=`exit/0 ~ the signed entry's cid prints`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares intent supersede

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host door/part spells/[[lares intent supersede]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

